Root cause:
The build error was caused by a mismatch in the context variable used when calling the function `_mesa_compute_version`. In the original code, the wrong context (`ctx`) was passed instead of the intended context (`mesaCtx`), leading to incorrect initialization and build failures. The patch corrected this by ensuring that the correct context is used consistently in function calls related to context operations.
